==Latvian==

===Etymology===
First recorded as a given name of Latvians in 1508. Ultimately from {{der|lv|grc|σοφία||wisdom}}.

===Proper noun===
{{head|lv|proper noun|g=f}}

# [[Sofia]] {{gloss|the city}}
# {{given name|lv|female|from=Ancient Greek|eq=Sophia}}.

